Package: CodingManageR
Title: Multi-User Qualitative Coding Portal and Training Manager
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Florian", family = "Berding",
           email = "florian.berding@uni-hamburg.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3593-1695"))
Description: A multi-user R Shiny web application and training portal for
    qualitative text coding across ordinal scales. Supports local SQLite
    databases for single-user desktop sessions as well as pooled
    MySQL/MariaDB connections for Open Source Shiny Server deployments.
    Provides 16 inter-rater reliability and agreement metrics, stratified
    gold-standard training pools, consolidated CSV master exports, strict
    schema-validated CSV imports, an interactive role-aware in-app Getting
    Started tutorial overlay, and bilingual (German/English) localization.
